 many desperadoes, using their burly physiques and heavy shields to provide shelter for their comrades.","abilities":[],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":18000,"atk":800,"def":800,"res":35,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"bottle_swordsman":{"slug":"bottle_swordsman","name":"Bottle Swordsman","icon":"/enemies-icons/Bottle Swordsman.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"Once a wandering physician's medicine bottle, it provided healing to many warriors. When it became a geist, it was moved by a talisman and put the talisman in its bottle, embarking on a journey of chivalry.","abilities":["Starts with 3 <Talismans>; attacks attach a <Talisman> to the target when carrying a <Talisman>"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":24000,"atk":500,"def":400,"res":30,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":4}},"shanhaizhong_skirmisher":{"slug":"shanhaizhong_skirmisher","name":"Shanhaizhong Skirmisher","icon":"/enemies-icons/Shanhaizhong Skirmisher.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"An ordinary Shanhaizhong member with a complex past. Their ridiculous slogan of 'the mounts, seas, and all in between shall be our master's' has spurred a large group of bandits to make trouble all over Yan.","abilities":["Can appear in the battlefield","Gains increased Attack Range when on Yumen Catastrophe Defenses"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":6500,"atk":400,"def":200,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.5}},"mirror_tianshi":{"slug":"mirror_tianshi","name":"Mirror Tianshi","icon":"/enemies-icons/Mirror Tianshi.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A well-polished mirror that believes it sees everything clearly. When it became a Geist, it was not content with just seeing things, but could not stop itself from giving unsolicited advice, just like the old scholars in the Tianshi Bureau.","abilities":["Picks a target from very long range, dealing Arts damage and sending a <Talisman>"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":0.4,"stats":{"hp":40000,"atk":300,"def":150,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":5}},"pseudomut":{"slug":"pseudomut","name":"Pseudomut","icon":"/enemies-icons/Pseudomut.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Similar in appearance to a Feranmut, it looks like an ancient 'God', but it is no more than a mere beast. It has become extinct in modern times, for its greed never diminished, despite no longer having the reputation of the Feranmuts to draw from.","abilities":["When blocked for the first time, devours the blocker and gains Low-Altitude Hovering","Returns devoured Operator when defeated"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":45000,"atk":450,"def":1500,"res":40,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"shanhaizhong_ringleader":{"slug":"shanhaizhong_ringleader","name":"Shanhaizhong Ringleader","icon":"/enemies-icons/Shanhaizhong Ringleader.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A Shanhaizhong leader hidden in their ranks. Elusive and unflinchingly cruel, are these acts of 'faith' delusional or simply selfish?","abilities":["Invisible","The next attack made after breaking Invisibility will deal increased damage"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":1.1,"stats":{"hp":12000,"atk":1000,"def":250,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.5}},"wang":{"slug":"wang","name":"'Wang'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Wang'.webp","rank":"Boss","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"The strategist, the sinner, the chess piece laid at the Tomb of Sui.","abilities":["Initial Form","[Placement] Whenever you deploy a unit, deploy a 'Flaw' in one of the 4 adjacent deployable tiles around it","[Placement] Periodically deploys a 'Flaw' on a deployable tile in one of the 4 adjacent tiles around your units that does not already have a unit","First Form","Nearby 'Flaws' will recover a percentage of HP every second and attack nearby your units, stunning them","For every nearby 'Flaw', Physical and Arts damage taken is reduced, and control effect duration is reduced","[Ladder] When a target on the field is 'Emptied', enters full-screen attack mode, prioritizing surrounded targets and attacking up to 3 targets at a time","Second Form","Deploys multiple 'Flaws' when entering second form; if a deployable tile surrounded by 'Flaws' does not have a unit, it will begin to spawn enemies continuously","After reviving, deploys a 'Flaw' on deployable tiles around your units","Leaves the field when the last 'Flaw' is defeated"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":200000,"atk":800,"def":1200,"res":60,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":4}},"wallbreaker":{"slug":"wallbreaker","name":"'Wallbreaker'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Wallbreaker'.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Machina","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A siege cannon engineered by the Ministry of Works, hijacked by the Shanhaizhong when they infiltrated Yumen. Yumen rampages over the sea of sand, advancing unhindered, shattering stone and resolve alike.","abilitie